# AI Development Rules

When implementing AI systems consider:

- Context management
- Cost
- Latency
- Reliability
- Security

AI features must define:

- Input
- Output
- Failure scenarios
- Evaluation criteria
- Guardrails

Never expose:

- Secrets
- API keys
- Private data

Prompts are versioned assets.

